{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.653 (vs. 0.650 in config_003) and similar F1 (0.628 vs. 0.628). The slight accuracy improvement suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal benefits, though the result remains uncertain due to minimal F1 change and potential confounding factors. Further experiments are needed to isolate the aggregation method's impact."
}

